  "title": "Teen's Secret Gets Exposed After Parent Finds A Strange Object Hidden Under His Bed",
  "byline": "Eligijus Sinkunas and Kornelija ViečaitėPrefer us in SearchFollow on Discover",
  "excerpt": "A dad had reason to distrust his kid and snooped inside his bedroom. What he found was more than just classic embarrassing items in a teenage boy’s bedroom — one object confused him so much that he asked people online for help identifying it. Based on the answers he got, the 16-year-old was about to face a long and serious conversation.",
